          "sentence": {
            "sentence_id": "s_u0_l03_011",
            "spans": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "For something to act, it cannot be entirely absent when that action occurs."
              }
            ],
            "source_ids": []
          },
          "visual_params": {
            "focus": -1
          }
        },
        {
          "point_id": "p_2",
          "sentence": {
            "sentence_id": "s_u0_l03_012",
            "spans": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "If it brought itself into existence, we would need it as an agent before it existed."
              }
            ],
            "source_ids": []
          },
          "visual_params": {
            "focus": 2
          }
        },
        {
          "point_id": "p_3",
          "sentence": {
            "sentence_id": "s_u0_l03_013",
            "spans": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "That makes the same thing “existing to act” and “not yet existing” at the same time."
              }
            ],
            "source_ids": []
          },
          "visual_params": {
            "focus": 3
          }
        },
        {
          "point_id": "p_4",
          "sentence": {
            "sentence_id": "s_u0_l03_014",
            "spans": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "“It made itself very quickly” does not solve this. Speed does not make a nonexistent thing an agent."
              }
            ],
            "source_ids": []
          },
          "visual_params": {
            "focus": 3
          }
        },
        {
          "point_id": "p_5",
          "sentence": {
            "sentence_id": "s_u0_l03_015",
            "spans": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "We are examining self-creation, not claiming that every change needs a human carpenter."
              }
            ],
            "source_ids": []
          },
          "visual_params": {
            "focus": -1
          }
        }
